<messaging:emailTemplate subject="NEW WA CLIENT BOOKED: {!RelatedTo.Account.Name} - WA BOOKING - {!RelatedTo.NSP_Booked_Month__c}" recipientType="User" relatedToType="Opportunity">
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >

   <html>
    <head>
<style>
table, th, td {
  border: 1px solid black;
  border-collapse: collapse;
}
</style>
</head>
    <body>
      This WA client is now booked and ready for implementation. Please see the necessary documents attached. <br/>
{!RelatedTo.NSP_BPA__r.Name}<br/>
Congrats on this deal! <br/>
These WA deals have been booked for {!RelatedTo.NSP_Booked_Month__c}<br/>

**NEXT STEPS**<br/>
Within two business days a Project Manager will be assigned to this implementation <br/>
Once assigned, the Project Manager will contact the client with the Welcome Email requesting a time for the Kick-Off Call <br/>
BPA will be included in this communication and on the initial Kick-Off Call as an optional participant <br/><br/>

For any questions on the process or next steps please contact <a href="#">TESintake@insperity.com</a><br/>
      
    </body>
</html>

</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>